{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52899","headline":"来往如梦偈 · 本净","name":"来往如梦偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"亦知（《景德传灯录》作「视生」）如在梦，睡（《景德传灯录》作「梦」）里实是闹。\n忽觉万事休，还同睡时觉（《景德传灯录》作「悟」）。\n智者会悟梦，迷人信梦闹。\n会梦无（《景德传灯录》作「如」）两般，一悟无别悟。\n富贵与贫贱，更亦无别道（《景德传灯录》作「更无分别路」。\n《祖堂集》卷三、《景德传灯录》卷五、《五灯会元》卷二）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"本净","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52899.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52899","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}